  "premise": "Twenty-seven-year-old Tenma Nozomi has retired from public fighting and been fired from underground fighting, and she and two friends start their own underground women's fighting circuit to make money, insisting on recruiting the unknown Hongou Hina. The venture pays well, but bringing in ever stronger fighters draws them into the affairs of a cult that has trained nine women as ultimate fighters, who must fight each other to decide which will usher in a 'new world order'. It shares a continuity with Kengan Ashura (Wikipedia, cached; Comikey blurb; ANN press release).",
